UnwrapNativeTest
├── when amount is max uint256
│   ├── when adapter has zero wrapped native balance
│   │   └── it should revert
│   └── when adapter has wrapped native balance
│       ├── when receiver is this adapter
│       │   └── it should unwrap and keep native in adapter
│       └── when receiver is not this adapter
│           └── it should unwrap and send native to receiver
└── when amount is not max uint256
    ├── when amount is zero
    │   └── it should revert
    └── when amount is greater than zero
        ├── when receiver is this adapter
        │   └── it should unwrap specified amount and keep native in adapter
        └── when receiver is not this adapter
            └── it should unwrap specified amount and send native to receiver 